{"D:\\wt\\sgardenspider\\vlog\\sgardenspider\\voz\\b000_t4.wav": {"text": "a small brown bottle of peppermint oil, a jug of white vinegar, and a bowl of lemon peels. That is what my mother used to send the spiders out of her house and her little shed in Osaka every fall. No spray, no poison, never once. And last week a young man with a tank on his back walked around my neighbor's garage for 10 minutes and asked her for $400. $400? Come, sit with me on the back step. I will show you what my mother did instead and why it still works in an old American garage 50 years later. You know the feeling. The first cold night of the fall, you open the garage door and there it is. A big web across the corner of the window with a fat brown spider sitting in the middle like she pays the rent. Webs on the shelves, webs on the rake, webs on the garden boots you left by the door. Little white egg sacks up in the corners of the shed. you", "words": [{"w": " a", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.12}, {"w": " small", "s": 0.12, "e": 0.52}, {"w": " brown", "s": 0.52, "e": 0.86}, {"w": " bottle", "s": 0.86, "e": 1.22}, {"w": " of", "s": 1.22, "e": 1.42}, {"w": " peppermint", "s": 1.42, "e": 1.92}, {"w": " oil,", "s": 1.92, "e": 2.9}, {"w": " a", "s": 2.9, "e": 2.92}, {"w": " jug", "s": 2.92, "e": 3.16}, {"w": " of", "s": 3.16, "e": 3.36}, {"w": " white", "s": 3.36, "e": 3.64}, {"w": " vinegar,", "s": 3.64, "e": 4.5}, {"w": " and", "s": 4.5, "e": 4.56}, {"w": " a", "s": 4.56, "e": 4.68}, {"w": " bowl", "s": 4.68, "e": 4.9}, {"w": " of", "s": 4.9, "e": 5.1}, {"w": " lemon", "s": 5.1, "e": 5.42}, {"w": " peels.", "s": 5.42, "e": 5.86}, {"w": " That", "s": 6.52, "e": 6.7}, {"w": " is", "s": 6.7, "e": 6.88}, {"w": " what", "s": 6.88, "e": 7.04}, {"w": " my", "s": 7.04, "e": 7.22}, {"w": " mother", "s": 7.22, "e": 7.52}, {"w": " used", "s": 7.52, "e": 7.78}, {"w": " to", "s": 7.78, "e": 7.98}, {"w": " send", "s": 7.98, "e": 8.16}, {"w": " the", "s": 8.16, "e": 8.36}, {"w": " spiders", "s": 8.36, "e": 8.82}, {"w